        <ExplanationTxt>The bookkeeping firm/CPA/audit firm shares a draft of the 990 form with the Operations Lead, who then shares it with the Board and Coordinating Commiitee for review. Any comments or questions are addressed and then the 990 is finalized. The Board Treasurer signs the form and it is sent to the bookkeeping firm/CPA/Audit form for submission.</ExplanationTxt>
